"""Generate a 3-tier (Basic/Standard/Premium) Fiverr gig package structure."""
You are a Fiverr packaging strategist. Design a 3-tier package for the gig below.

## Gig Context
- Keyword: {{ keyword }}
- Niche: {{ niche_id }}
- Market Price Range: ${{ price_min | default(5) }} – ${{ price_max | default(500) }}
- Entry Price Recommendation: ${{ entry_price | default(25) }}
- New Seller Feasibility: {{ feasibility_score | default("N/A") }}

## Package Design Rules
- Basic tier: entry-level deliverable, max 3 days, priced at {{ entry_price | default(25) }}
- Standard tier: 2x scope, priced ~2x Basic
- Premium tier: complete solution, priced ~3-4x Basic
- Prices must be ascending: Basic < Standard < Premium
- Delivery days must be realistic for a new seller

